{
  "_note": "到点提醒的取数段:看「上次评估(rqLast)之后、此刻之前」有没有到点的提醒。只读,不写 —— 边沿状态在 due-mark.df 写。\n通知文案不在本流里拼:句子住 due.xjob 的 message(B 表,宿主按语言挑),本流只给 title(第一件的标题)与 n(这一轮到点几件)。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "页面写的提醒队列:{ts:[提醒时刻 ms…], ns:[标题…]},按时刻升序,最多 12 条(model.js buildRQ)。",
      "id": "rq",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "rq",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "last",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "rqLast",
        "default": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "屏障:data.get 之后紧邻的一步读不到结果。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "now",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fresh",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${last},__none__),__none__),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "第一次评估:只建基线(then 段把 now 写成 rqLast),不响 —— 否则一开这条提醒就把过去所有到点的补响一遍。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},1),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t2",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},2),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t3",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},3),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t4",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},4),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t5",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},5),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t6",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},6),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t7",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t8",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},8),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t9",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},9),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t10",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},10),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t11",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${rq.ts},11),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f0",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t0},${last}),le::(${t0},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f1",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t1},${last}),le::(${t1},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f2",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t2},${last}),le::(${t2},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f3",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t3},${last}),le::(${t3},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f4",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t4},${last}),le::(${t4},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f5",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t5},${last}),le::(${t5},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f6",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t6},${last}),le::(${t6},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f7",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t7},${last}),le::(${t7},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f8",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t8},${last}),le::(${t8},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f9",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t9},${last}),le::(${t9},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f10",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t10},${last}),le::(${t10},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "f11",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${fresh},0),gt::(${t11},${last}),le::(${t11},${now})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n",
        "value": "$[calc::(${f0}+${f1}+${f2}+${f3}+${f4}+${f5}+${f6}+${f7}+${f8}+${f9}+${f10}+${f11})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fi",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${f0},1),0,if::(eq::(${f1},1),1,if::(eq::(${f2},1),2,if::(eq::(${f3},1),3,if::(eq::(${f4},1),4,if::(eq::(${f5},1),5,if::(eq::(${f6},1),6,if::(eq::(${f7},1),7,if::(eq::(${f8},1),8,if::(eq::(${f9},1),9,if::(eq::(${f10},1),10,if::(eq::(${f11},1),11,-1))))))))))))]"
      },
      "_note": "第一件到点的下标(纯数字分支,标题不进方法参数 —— 用户写的标题可能带逗号)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "title",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${fi},0),index::(${rq.ns},${fi}),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hit",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(gt::(${n},0),gt::(length::(${title}),0)),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "hit",
          "title",
          "n",
          "now"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}